{"id":"b349c4a4adf1aa47","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-predicate-signature.md","title":"df-predicate-signature","display":"df-predicate-signature","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-predicate-signature","aliases":["16-df-predicate-signature","Predicate signature"],"display":"df-predicate-signature","depends_on":["[[16-df-first-order-spec]]"],"source":"Definition 4.1.1 and preceding description, p.222 (PDF242); flat arity-map presentation","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-predicate-signature"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-predicate-signature</span><span>Predicate signature</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-predicate-signature"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"526d014f8a51723a\" href=\"?note=526d014f8a51723a\" title=\"16-df-first-order-spec\">16-df-first-order-spec</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 4.1.1 and preceding description, p.222 (PDF242); flat arity-map presentation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,F,P\">\\(S,F,P\\)</span> 为小集合，分别为排序、函数符号和谓词符号的载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P\\)</span> 是候选型属函数图，不在前提中预设型属条件成立。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(S,F,\\operatorname{ar}_F)\">\\(\\Sigma=(S,F,\\operatorname{ar}_F)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(P,\\operatorname{ar}_P)\">\\(\\Pi=(P,\\operatorname{ar}_P)\\)</span> 为候选记录。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^*\">\\(S^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredSig}\">\\(\\mathrm{PredSig}\\)</span> 与合并记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\Sigma,\\Pi}\">\\(\\widehat{\\Sigma,\\Pi}\\)</span> 以下文为定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSig}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSig}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"526d014f8a51723a\" href=\"?note=526d014f8a51723a\" title=\"16-df-first-order-spec\">16-df-first-order-spec</a> 的五元签名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nS^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}S^n,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma,\\Pi}&amp;\\coloneqq(S,F,P,\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PredSig}(\\Sigma,\\Pi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ar}_F:F\\to S^*\\times S\\land\\operatorname{ar}_P:P\\to S^*,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PredSig}(\\Sigma,\\Pi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\widehat{\\Sigma,\\Pi}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nS^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}S^n,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma,\\Pi}&amp;\\coloneqq(S,F,P,\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PredSig}(\\Sigma,\\Pi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ar}_F:F\\to S^*\\times S\\land\\operatorname{ar}_P:P\\to S^*,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PredSig}(\\Sigma,\\Pi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\widehat{\\Sigma,\\Pi}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 4.1.1 及其前文，p.222（PDF242），以每个排序列表对应一个谓词符号集表示签名。本页把这些符号集作带元数标签的不交并，等价地用单个符号集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 及型属映射表示；反向以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_P^{-1}\\{\\vec s\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_P^{-1}\\{\\vec s\\}\\)</span> 恢复各符号集。零元谓词由空列表包含在内。</p>\n<p>函数符号的型属含一个输出排序，谓词符号的型属只含输入排序列表；关系解释不属于签名本身。五元合并记录显式连接到本书的一阶签名接口；不再凭相近文件名猜测参数顺序，也不在前提中先假定本页将检查的型属性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-first-order-spec","status":"resolved","id":"526d014f8a51723a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-first-order-spec]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-first-order-spec","status":"resolved","id":"526d014f8a51723a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(S,F,\\operatorname{ar}_F)$、$\\Pi=(P,\\operatorname{ar}_P)$ 为候选记录。$S^*$、$\\mathrm{PredSig}$ 与合并记录 $\\widehat{\\Sigma,\\Pi}$ 以下文为定义；$\\mathrm{FOSig}$ 采用 [[16-df-first-order-spec]] 的五元签名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S,F,P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(S,F,\\operatorname{ar}_F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi=(P,\\operatorname{ar}_P)","display":false},{"tex":"S^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredSig}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\Sigma,\\Pi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOSig}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nS^*&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}S^n,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma,\\Pi}&\\coloneqq(S,F,P,\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PredSig}(\\Sigma,\\Pi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ar}_F:F\\to S^*\\times S\\land\\operatorname{ar}_P:P\\to S^*,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PredSig}(\\Sigma,\\Pi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\widehat{\\Sigma,\\Pi}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_P^{-1}\\{\\vec s\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1929,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-301","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-predicate-signature|df-predicate-signature]]"}],"outgoing":["526d014f8a51723a"]}